From f1208ea2831201ecc960ff6c7fe9740b700d4e62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 04:42:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Char's 3 Day Split 2.0 program

One-time, Char-only program update: adds three new workouts (Glutes and
Hamstrings 2.0, Tricep / Bicep / Shoulders 2.0, Posterior / Quads 2.0)
alongside the existing ones and points the Mon/Wed/Fri plan at them.
More sets on the main lifts, heavier rep ranges, and new exercises
(sumo deadlift, glute kickbacks, lat pulldown, EZ bar cable curls,
hack squat, leg extension, cable pull-through).

Old workouts, logs and exercise history are kept. Tracked via
settings.programVersion so it runs once and syncs across devices. With
cloud sync it waits for both the profile and exercise library snapshots
so new workouts reference the shared exercise ids. Bumps asset version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NmzAiSaBFDjr4hTH4jUVBS
